msgid "intro/improvements/description"
msgstr ""
"Earn Combat XP to unlock nodes that enhance your vehicle's characteristics. "
"The final characteristics may end up either higher or lower than the values "
"indicated due to additional additive and multiplicative modifiers applied "
"after node bonuses."

